Subject: [PATCH 4/9] vkd3d-shader/fx: Support writing sampler state
 initializers for fx_2_0.

Assignments of each element are stored contiguously in the unstructured
section. Resources of the sampler state assignments are identified by the
parameter and element index.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01LkAyMz3ChWUcwV1bWoNa1Z
